        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"307953\">@Ruben Van de Velde</span>  I don't mind at all. Yes, heavily. As a primary care physician by trade I don't have the muscle memory for idiomatic Lean 4 or Mathlib syntax which I find gruesome (skill issue, am terrible at it), specially since this proof is an application/evidence of a bigger physics project of mine.</p>",
