        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"1046427\">Juan Pablo Silva Alvarado</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/116395-maths/topic/Formalized.20reduction.20of.20the.201.2F3-2.2F3.20Poset.20Conjecture/near/579031924\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>since this proof is an application/evidence of a bigger physics project of mine.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Would you elaborate at all on this?</p>",
